{"id":"34f1c7d95297d4b7","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-fubini-tonelli.md","title":"Fubini–Tonelli","display":"thm-fubini-tonelli — Fubini–Tonelli","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-fubini-tonelli","aliases":["58-thm-fubini-tonelli"],"display":"thm-fubini-tonelli — Fubini–Tonelli","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-fubini-tonelli"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-fubini-tonelli</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fubini-tonelli — Fubini–Tonelli"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md\">../batch01/58-df-integrability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ad78f775172312be\" href=\"?note=ad78f775172312be\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,\\Sigma,\\rho,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,\\Sigma,\\rho,f\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad78f775172312be\" href=\"?note=ad78f775172312be\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7df291a6731ae8a3\" href=\"?note=7df291a6731ae8a3\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md\">../batch01/58-df-integrability.md</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_x=\\{\\langle y,f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\">\\(f_x=\\{\\langle y,f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^y=\\{\\langle x,f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\">\\(f^y=\\{\\langle x,f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\)</span>；非负、有符号积分值和二元积测度取自 <code>58-df-signed-integral-data</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下两个断言共享前提：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\rho;X,\\mathcal A,\\mu;Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X\\times Y,\\Sigma,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\rho;X,\\mathcal A,\\mu;Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X\\times Y,\\Sigma,f)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}tonelli}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\geq0\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\;\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty]^Y\\;\\exists r\\in[0,\\infty]\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(g(x),f_x,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(h(y),f^y,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,g,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,h,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}tonelli}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\geq0\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\;\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty]^Y\\;\\exists r\\in[0,\\infty]\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(g(x),f_x,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(h(y),f^y,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,g,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,h,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}tonelli}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\to\\exists N_X\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists N_Y\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^X\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb R^Y\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\mu(N_X)=0\\land\\nu(N_Y)=0\n\\land\\forall x\\in N_X\\;g(x)=0\\land\\forall y\\in N_Y\\;h(y)=0\\\\\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N_X\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(g(x),f_x,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\setminus N_Y\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(h(y),f^y,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,g,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,h,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}tonelli}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\to\\exists N_X\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists N_Y\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^X\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb R^Y\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\mu(N_X)=0\\land\\nu(N_Y)=0\n\\land\\forall x\\in N_X\\;g(x)=0\\land\\forall y\\in N_Y\\;h(y)=0\\\\\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N_X\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(g(x),f_x,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\setminus N_Y\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(h(y),f^y,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,g,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,h,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>两个公式分别表达 Tonelli 与 Fubini。第一式允许积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span>；第二式的内积分只在相应零测例外集之外要求存在，外积分使用在例外集上取零的代表元。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ad78f775172312be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ad78f775172312be","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-integrability.md","status":"resolved","id":"7df291a6731ae8a3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-integrability.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$、$\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,\\Sigma,\\rho,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"f_x=\\{\\langle y,f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:y\\in Y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f^y=\\{\\langle x,f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{BinaryProductMeasure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\rho;X,\\mathcal A,\\mu;Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X\\times Y,\\Sigma,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}tonelli}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\geq0\\Bigr)\n\\to\\exists g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\;\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty]^Y\\;\\exists r\\in[0,\\infty]\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(g(x),f_x,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(h(y),f^y,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,g,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,h,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}tonelli}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PIntegrable}_S(f,1,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\to\\exists N_X\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists N_Y\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^X\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb R^Y\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n\\mu(N_X)=0\\land\\nu(N_Y)=0\n\\land\\forall x\\in N_X\\;g(x)=0\\land\\forall y\\in N_Y\\;h(y)=0\\\\\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N_X\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(g(x),f_x,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\n\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\setminus N_Y\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(h(y),f^y,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,X\\times Y,\\Sigma,\\rho)\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,g,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,h,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"+\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":3106,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-fubini-tonelli.md|58-thm-fubini-tonelli]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["7df291a6731ae8a3","bbbec05fde1d3b01","ad78f775172312be","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d"]}